WEBVTT

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:44.750
Pastel * Palettes here, 
doing our very, very best!

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:46.460
Gosh, I was so nervous!

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.290
Please keep cheering us on!

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.670
The Era of the Girl Band

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.750
Girl bands are a big deal right now,

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:55.580
with a slew of competitions
being hosted all over the country!

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:58.460
It's the era of the girl band right now!

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:02.250
The era of the girl band?

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.080
Wake up!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.870
Time for A-chan's entrance ceremony!

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.880
Be back later!

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:54.130
Mom told me to take a bunch
of pictures of you today.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.080
I'm so glad your high school's nearby.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.790
We can still commute together!

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.750
Once classes start, I might head out early.

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:02.470
What?

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.670
Well, Haneoka's a college 
prep school, after all.

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:06.920
I thought I might do some morning studying.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.130
A-chan, you're amazing!

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.250
Sis...

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.080
A-chan!

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.860
Congrats on your first day of high school!

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:24.210
Aw...

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.670
Hanasakigawa
Girls' Academy
Entrance
Ceremony

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:31.500
Welcome to Hanasakigawa!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.960
Oh, it's just you, Kasumi.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.130
Yay!

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.670
Hurry and put your stuff away.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:36.540
I will!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.250
Rinko-senpai?

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.690
What are you doing down there?

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:44.130
Umm... Just practicing my speech.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.290
What speech?

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:48.010
I-I'm our new student council president...

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.100
Oh!

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:50.830
Are you gonna speak too, Arisa?

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.710
I'm just the secretary.

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:53.710
Toyama-san.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.480
Sayo-senpai!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.000
Good morning!

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.660
Good morning.
Thanks for helping out today.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:03.500
Oh, your ribbon's crooked.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.710
Mind your manners.

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:09.420
The new students will be arriving soon.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:12.670
As upperclassmen, I expect you
to be on your best behavior.

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:13.670
Okay.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:15.580
Hah, we're upperclassmen!

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.500
Yeah...

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.000
Um, excuse me...

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.840
Hiya- Uh, good morning!

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.710
Haneoka Girls' Academy

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:27.720
Haneoka Girls' Academy
Entrance Ceremony

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:27.720
Um, next up, a message from our
student council president.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.330
Okay, testing testing...

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:34.080
Everyone, congrats on your first day here!

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:36.500
I'm your student council 
president, Hina Hikawa.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:41.410
Studying hard is a big deal here at Haneoka,
but as your president...

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:43.210
I say we have FUN!

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.940
Senpai, your speech!

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.700
Aren't you in Roselia?!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.330
Undoubtedly!

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:56.790
It is I, uh... Ako, the Princess of Darkness!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.870
What's Yukina-senpai like?
Risa-senpai is sooo cool!

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:01.290
You're so cute, Ako-chan!
Am I in the right place...?

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:07.380
Ugh, I'm such a klutz.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:08.880
Sorry! You okay?

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:10.960
Are you passing these out?

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:15.170
Yeah, I'm first on the attendance sheet,
so the teacher asked me to do it.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.730
Oh, seriously?

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.960
S-seriously.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.580
Does your last name start with "A"?

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:24.570
Mhm, Asahi.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:26.670
I'm Rokka Asahi.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:27.580
Thanks!

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:29.660
Thanks for your help.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:33.080
We were a little low on manpower with just
the student council and discipline committee.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.100
No problem, we had fun!

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.000
Everyone was so cute, huh!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:37.750
Huh?

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.580
How much longer do you plan on
moping, Shirokane-san?

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.640
I'm sorry...

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:45.210
Hanasakigawa Girls' Academy
Entrance Ceremony

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.750
H-hello, I'm your stu...

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:51.170
student council president... Rinko Shirokane.

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:56.830
Why would you become president
if you're afraid of public speaking?

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:01.420
The previous president asked her to...
or FORCED her to, really.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:02.500
You too, Arisa?

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:07.380
No, but I heard being on student council
looks good on your report card...

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:09.580
She DID ask me to do it, but...

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:12.540
but I wanted to get over this, you know?

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:16.330
The first step to conquering your fears
is exposing yourself to them.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:21.000
As fellow keyboardists,
I hope we can do our best going forward.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:24.960
That sounds great and all, but what does it
have to do with us being keyboardists?

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.630
I-I suppose...

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.580
I wonder how our upperclassmen are doing?

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.260
And Rimi, for that matter.

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:34.750
Is everything okay with Ushigome-san?

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:36.960
Well, she's been a little down lately...

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:40.810
Her sister... Yuri-senpai decided
to go to college overseas.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:43.790
Chocolate Cornet

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.670
Look, chocolate cornets at Saaya's bakery.

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:49.670
Have you found any yummy bakeries
over there yet, Sis?

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:54.630
Rimi-rin!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.170
Saaya-chan!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.370
If you're taking videos, at 
least put on a little smile!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:06.130
Yamabuki Bakery

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:00.710
Okay...

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.330
Saaya-chan, you smell nice.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.580
Maybe it's the melon bread.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:11.670
I'm dying.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.470
It's just a little farther!

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.330
You're overestimating this hermit.

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:17.380
Haven't you been going to school every day?

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:20.080
Yeah, you're the one who drags me there...

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:27.580
I can't help but feel excited.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:28.290
Huh?

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:29.170
Aren't you?

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.170
Not really.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.790
What?! It's spring! School's starting!

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:34.670
We just moved up a year, big deal.

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:35.830
We're upperclassmen now!

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:37.750
Heh, lemme process that for a sec.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:38.960
Ichigaya-senpai!

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:40.500
Okay, okay, I'm coming.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.210
Arisa!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.170
Grandma, I'm home.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.250
Hi!

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:49.460
Welcome home. O-Tae-chan's here.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.460
Okay!

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:57.050
O-Tae!

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:58.210
Hey.

00:08:58.210 --> 00:08:59.460
All done at work?

00:08:59.460 --> 00:08:59.970
Yep.

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.350
What were you just playing?

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:02.630
Wanna join me?

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:03.790
Of course!

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:04.960
How 'bout you, Arisa?

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.560
Break time!

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.880
You look tired.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.670
You can sleep when you're dead!

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.500
Ugh, stop it!

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:15.330
Toyama

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:15.330
How was Haneoka?

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.880
Umm, a little different from what I expected.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:20.750
I thought it would have a more serious vibe.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:25.160
Yukina-senpai from Roselia,

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:28.130
plus Ran-chan and the girls from
Afterglow go there too, huh.

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:30.170
Are those your band friends?

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:33.290
Yep! It must be so fun going to a new school!

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:34.750
You think so?

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.040
But...

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:37.920
Did you make some friends?

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:39.670
Sure.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:41.750
I'm gonna work hard too!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:42.580
At what?

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:43.670
Mmm...

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:44.920
I dunno!

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:47.540
Don't catch a cold, now.

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:48.630
I won't!

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.330
Hanasakigawa Girls' Academy

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:50.750
We're together!

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.170
Same class!

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:54.670
Class 2-A
Class 2-B

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:54.670
Yes! We're together!

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:56.080
I can see that.

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:57.170
Class B!

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.040
What about you, O-Tae?

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.040
O-Tae-chan...

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:03.330
O-Tae!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:04.580
So, guys...

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:07.040
How about switching to Class E?

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:07.870
We can't!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:11.500
Even if we're in different classes,
we can still hang out at lunch and afterschool.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.040
Sorry, I've got work today.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:14.130
Hey.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:15.550
Welcome to
Class 2-B

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:20.210
How are you doing, Sis?

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.130
I'm doing great!

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:23.930
We're in our second year of high school now,

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:25.930
Math II

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:26.540
so we've got more responsibilities

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:30.100
and everyone's busy with
cram school and part-time jobs.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.770
I'll send you video soon!

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:38.130
I'm sure you have a lot on your plate right now,
but take care and do your best, okay?

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.750
Sorry! My meeting ran late-

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.000
Shh.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:11:00.210
Hey, Arisa. Did you run all the way here?

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:01.330
No...

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:05.750
Morning!

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:09.350
Morning! Ready to head home?

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.330
What?

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.540
Arisa?

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:13.830
I-it's fine.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.330
See ya, Arisa.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:16.790
See you at school.

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:18.250
See you tomorrow.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:21.610
I, uh... need to go by the convenience store!

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.920
What are you all giggling about?!

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:30.290
It's been a while since 
we've all hung out, huh.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.710
Wanna play shiritori?

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:32.750
Why?

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:35.080
Did you get a little rest, O-Tae-chan?

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.550
I dreamed I was playing my guitar.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.500
I think you like guitar too much...

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.420
You were playing keyboard too, Arisa.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:43.130
What?

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:45.040
Rimi was on bass,

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:47.330
Saaya was banging her drums,

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.750
and Kasumi was singing 
and playing her guitar.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.250
I wanna play live again.

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:59.830
Even if it's just at the warehouse,
I wanna play with you guys.

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:02.290
Yeah! I was just thinking that!

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:03.540
A live show, huh?

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:04.920
Ooh, I'm in!

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:06.700
That sounds good!

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:09.750
Okay!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.080
Wait, really at the warehouse?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.170
What about the parking lot?

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:13.830
That would be cool!

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.130
Is there electricity?

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.420
We'd have to get permission.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:17.630
Wait, are you serious?!

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:18.630
E-excuse me!

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:27.080
Um, you guys are Pop-Poppin' 
Party, aren't you?

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:28.420
Y-yeah.

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.560
I need your help!

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:31.980
What?

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:35.500
Could you guys come and 
perform at Galaxy tonight?

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:39.670
Renewal Celebration Show!
Performances By
Hello, Happy World!
(in no particular order)

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.250
Afterglow are so cool.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:29.750
They're so confident.

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:32.410
It's their first time playing 
here, but they're so good...

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:35.910
Hey, don't just oogle at 
them! You need to listen!

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.500
Sorry, Asahi-san.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:41.210
It's okay! PoPiPa are last up tonight,
so you can relax for now!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.840
The turnout's great!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:47.330
Yeah! Thanks to you guys,
our renewal opening has been a huge success!

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:50.350
Not too bad, Galaxy!

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.040
We're Afterglow!

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:55.060
Thanks! See you soon!

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:59.420
Is it pretty different 
now, after the renewal?

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:01.500
I only just started working here...

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.170
Happy, Lu-

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:04.940
Huh?

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:06.710
Hagu! Kokoron!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:07.580
Kasumi!

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:08.750
Huh? Ka-kun?

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:10.040
Oh, we're backstage.

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:13.040
Huh? I thought this was 
the door to the stage.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:14.500
Fleeting...

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.790
Hello-Happy, you guys are up next.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.000
I'll introduce you!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:22.380
Okay! Well- Wait, where 
are Kanon and Michelle?

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.250
Must be lost!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.380
Michelle!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.590
Kano-chan-senpai!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.170
Sorry! I'll be back in a bit!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.710
Hello, Happy World, wait for me!

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:30.720
See you around, little kittens!

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.420
Are they gonna make it?

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:33.830
Oh boy...

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:35.680
They're late.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:38.580
Where did Kokoro-chan and 
the others run off to?

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:40.290
Michelle!

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.880
Over there! Michelle!

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.240
Found you!

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.170
Th-there you are!

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:49.330
Kokoro?!

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.080
Here we go!

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.540
Happy! Lucky! Smile!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.250
Yay!

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:58.210
"Orchestra of Smiles!"

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:19.790
Whoa, they're so cute!

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:21.290
They sure jump around a lot.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:22.830
I'm sweating...

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.710
I feel like I lost 5 kilos!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:28.130
Oh, totally! More like 10 kilos!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.630
Tomoe, that doesn't even make sense.

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.130
Himari-chan, you shouldn't 
worry about that stuff...

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:35.760
Nice job out there! You guys were so cool!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.880
Oh, thanks...

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:39.880
We just played like we always do.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:43.080
Hmm? Looking a little red there, Ran.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.330
It's hot in here.

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:45.960
PoPiPa are up last, right?

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:48.250
Yep. Kasumi made a really lucky pull.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.540
How lucky...

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:51.130
Super lucky!

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:54.080
Lucky or not, you've got
an important job as the final act.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.860
Mhm! We'll give it our all.

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:59.210
Roselia here. Let's put on a good show today.

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:01.080
I didn't see you at rehearsal today.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.170
Hope that doesn't affect your 
performance, Minato-san.

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:04.250
Wha- Ran!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:07.830
Don't worry, we had our own rehearsal.

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:09.880
Besides, it looks like 
things are just heating up.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.790
Um, Roselia are up-

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:12.960
Sis!

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:15.430
Ako! I'll be watching from the crowd.

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:16.500
Okay!

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:19.170
Let's go.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:21.000
"Louder."

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:09.000
Yukina!

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:16.170
Good luck!

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:17.670
Thanks!

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:19.920
Thanks, my lovelies! Bye bye!

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:20.830
Ako-chan!

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:21.830
RinRin!

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:30.080
Po-Pi-Pa!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:31.170
Pi-Po-Pa!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:33.670
Po-Pi-Pa-Pa-Pi-Po-Pa!

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:38.750
Hiya! We're...

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.710
Poppin' Party!

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.670
It's been a while since our last show,
so we're a little nervous!

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:46.790
But we're so happy to be here!

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.880
Yep, almost feels like coming home.

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:51.330
Uh, you know it's our first time here, right?

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:55.790
We all met at school and 
formed this band together!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:57.250
We know!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.470
On lead guitar, Tae Hanazono!

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.050
On bass, Rimi Ushigome!

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:02.840
On drums, Saaya Yamabuki!

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:04.850
On keyboard, Arisa Ichigaya!

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.540
And I'm Kasumi Toyama on guitar and vocals!

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:09.890
The five of us are Poppin' Party!

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.920
Kasumi-chan, you already said that.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:14.130
You've got this!

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:17.230
This one's called "Happy Happy Party!"

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:19.910
Whooo!

00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:22.060
PoPiPa, you're the best!

00:22:22.060 --> 00:22:26.000
You rock, PoPiPa!

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:29.290
That was so much fun!

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:30.660
Thank you all!

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:33.540
Great job!

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:39.420
Thank you!

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:43.750
We've got an announcement before you go.

00:22:45.080 --> 00:22:49.830
Next month, we, Roselia will be
sponsoring our own live show.

00:22:50.170 --> 00:22:52.350
Sponsoring a show...?

00:22:52.630 --> 00:22:55.920
A grand Roselia performance,
by Roselia, for Roselia fans!

00:22:55.920 --> 00:22:58.290
Look forward to it, my lovelies!

00:22:58.290 --> 00:22:59.540
You too, RinRin!

00:22:59.540 --> 00:23:00.750
R-right.

00:23:00.750 --> 00:23:06.080
W-we're a little nervous about sponsoring,
but we're gonna d-do our best!

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:07.750
See you all there!

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:10.570
That's it. Are there any other announcements?

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:14.080
Yep!

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:16.370
We've got a show coming up too!

00:23:18.620 --> 00:23:21.540
Poppin' Party are performing live!

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.540
Next Time: Black Shout
